Read the advFwd / solFwd columns together: as the zone shrinks, the
mechanism should shift from advertisement-driven to solicitation-driven.
If the total control overhead rises to meet the reactive reference as the
zone approaches one hop, the hybrid advantage is a function of the zone
covering the network, and the paper must say so.

